DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp development changes (2026)
Added the dsv4_vision model contract, image layout, validation and operator work.
Added native FP4/FP8 loading, physical TP2 slices and the ViT/aligner graph.
Modified build integration and added the model's row to the README model table.
DeepSeek's MIT reference was used for model semantics and image preprocessing;
the license is retained in LICENSES/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-MIT.txt.
The Bertholomus AI V4.1 fork supplies selectively adapted TCP/NCCL control code
and the lane/server adapter pattern (dfc8fe50af303fcbdda0e839cae3a18eb53be2e1).
Copyright 2026 BertholomusAI (Albert Lee), Apache-2.0.
Added a text TP2 reference graph, rank worker and native server registration.
DeepSeek encoding_dsv4.py supplies adapted chat, reasoning, DSML and image encoding.
DeepSeek model.py supplies DSpark stage, target-tap, Markov and confidence semantics.
Distributed snapshots and HTTP vision extend TensorFold's existing cache and lane APIs.
The MiaAI-Lab GLM recipe was consulted for operations only; no AGPL source copied.
Detailed sources and implementation status: docs/recipes/deepseek-v4-flash-vision.md.

